	(text "Select mode ONLY with USB unplugged and 3V3 discharged.\nOne shunt: RUN=1-2; FLASH RP=3-4; FLASH ESP=5-6.\nBoth FLASH shunts: both USB switches disabled; both CPUs reset.\nRUN_MODE additionally qualifies the future Zorro output-enable circuit."
