	(text "USB-C is ALWAYS a power sink. Run uses internal D+/D- only.\nSupply / data-capable PC port must advertise >=1.5 A.\nDefault-current ports intentionally leave main rail OFF.\nNo external VBUS-source switch. No Amiga +5V power connection."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 431.8 134.62 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b0e4ebe8-5887-457e-a5cb-aea6786c1906")
	)
	(text "BOOT controls do not depend on application firmware.\nQ1/Q2 hold the peer reset. Q3/Q4 force selected ROM boot.\nRP_BOOT_N joins QSPI_SS through this sheet's 1k path.\n27R RP and 22R ESP series resistors belong at MCU pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 431.8 205.74 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "9c15f390-1b7d-4c7b-998d-38728595877d")
	)
	(text "Power selection: CC OUT1 low permits main power.\nFUSB303B GPIO mode: ADDR left open; PORT via 100k to GND.\nTPS22917 CT capacitor goes to VIN, NOT GND.\nNo board placement or USB impedance claim at this stage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 431.8 276.86 0.0000)
